pective and to expand the story and your understanding of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876610/extras/aa3c292fef60f56d6c9a9b9f6aaafa68.poster.avif?t=1754599974\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876610/extras/aa3c292fef60f56d6c9a9b9f6aaafa68.webm?t=1754599974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876610/extras/aa3c292fef60f56d6c9a9b9f6aaafa68.mp4?t=1754599974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some stories will be obvious, others are hidden. Explore the world and unlock them all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876610/extras/fd976b6ed06da94f3de83ddf6c7db7d9.poster.avif?t=1754599974\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876610/extras/fd976b6ed06da94f3de83ddf6c7db7d9.webm?t=1754599974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876610/extras/fd976b6ed06da94f3de83ddf6c7db7d9.mp4?t=1754599974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
